          <div class="reveal" data-delay="200">
            <div style="margin-top:22px;font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;max-width:360px;text-align:left">
              <i data-lucide="shield-check" style="width:16px;height:16px;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px"></i>
              Konsultasi gratis dulu. Tanpa pressure, tanpa biaya tersembunyi.
